10 REM BITS.BAS: DRAWS A MOVING DIAGONAL STRIPE IN RAM WITH POKE.
20 REM OPEN THE aPE-RAM WATCHDOG AND CLICK THE PAGE THAT APPEARS FOR
30 REM VIRTUAL ADDRESS &H8000 OF THIS PROCESS. CTRL+C STOPS IT.
40 A = &H8000
50 PRINT "DRAWING AT &H8000... (CTRL+C TO STOP)"
60 F = 0
70 FOR R = 0 TO 15
80 POKE A + R * 16 + (R + F + 15) MOD 16, 0
90 POKE A + R * 16 + (R + F) MOD 16, 255
100 NEXT R
110 F = (F + 1) MOD 16
120 SLEEP 0.1
130 GOTO 70
